SECTION | KEY | VALUE
----------------------------------------
# voices.pdl - how each rpg-pet pet sounds (own voices: none are the old pet-trainer voices). Edit, no rebuild.
# VOICE | pet id | edge-tts voice | rate | pitch | language     language en | zh | ja | ko: the pet SPEAKS its greetings and replies in that language (the chat window keeps English for you).
# Speech = edge-tts (online, free), cached as a wav per pet and phrase in state/audio, played quietly, one sound at a time. No network / no player = silence, never an error.
# Chinese, Japanese and Korean are first-class: the house serves those audiences (CJK glyph rendering exists in board-viewer; window text stays English for now, see ROADMAP "language support").
# A pet only speaks aloud while it is on screen. Menu > Voice on/off (flag voice).
VOICE | blip  | ja-JP-NanamiNeural   | +20% | +60Hz | ja
VOICE | fang  | zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural   | +10% | +50Hz | zh
VOICE | gruk  | ko-KR-InJoonNeural   | +5%  | -20Hz | ko
VOICE | draxa | en-GB-ThomasNeural   | -10% | -40Hz | en
VOICE | gargo | ja-JP-KeitaNeural    | -15% | -40Hz | ja
